Iron Flesh is a monk discipline that conditions the skin and underlying
tissue to resist physical attacks. Through rigorous training, the monk's
body develops a natural toughness that provides protection equivalent to
wearing armor.

This passive skill grants an armor bonus to any unarmored body parts. The
more skilled the monk becomes, the greater the protection. This allows
monks to fight effectively without heavy armor, maintaining their speed
and agility while still having meaningful protection.

Iron Flesh works best when the monk fights with minimal equipment,
embracing the philosophy that the body itself is the ultimate weapon
and shield.

Class: Monk
Discipline: Iron Body

